    "definition": "480 nonnegative rational heights, width13/4800 and support13/10. Maximize exact minimum autocorrelation on shifts[0,1] divided by squared L1 mass. Piecewise linearity reduces full interval to nodes0..369 and exact endpoint interpolation at369+3/13.",
